  "question": {
    "text": "The focus and corresponding directrix of an ellipse are <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3,4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> respectively. If the eccentricity of the ellipse is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>, then the coordinates of the centre of the ellipse are"
  },
